# Pricing core

- Keep `app/pricing.py` free of I/O; pass config as plain dicts/lists.
- Use `Decimal` for money and rates; round only in `app/serialize.py` for API output.
- Band logic lives in `app/bands.py`; parsers call overlap checks before save.
- Ineligible paths must set explicit `reasons`; no silent catch-all eligibility.
- Tests in `tests/` must cover boundary bands and upload validation.